<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-040-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) Dürer/Camper human profile grid deformations (Pass 2) — MorphoEval overall 74.3/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Full validation on digitised Fig. 364 profiles: homologous TPS RMSE ≪ label-shuffled null (ratio ≫ 1); Camper φ ordering preserved across profiles; specimen CV mask + core landmark in-mask fraction ≥ 0.8; KS rejects shuffled residual equality (p ≪ 0.05). Overall 74.3/100 (faithfulness 71.9, reproducibility 80.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit cc716ad5c8529ea438a8998b3d46e62a3e104f44; environment: python 3.12, numpy 2.x, scipy 1.x, matplotlib 3.x, Pillow 10.x. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 82, Morphological realism / specimen match 58, Parameter expressivity 74, Morphometric validation 80, Source and data traceability 86, Code-to-model traceability 76, Reproducibility package 78. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_040_on_the_theory_of_transformatio_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-040_on-the-theory-of-transformations.py at cc716ad5c8529ea438a8998b3d46e62a3e104f44, image/png, 433332 B, 1650×1050 px, artifact_sha256 10530256f9684574b7033781fb7f1af9e7ef5ea65245638ed887c3666a94d7ba (sha256 10530256f9684574b7033781fb7f1af9e7ef5ea65245638ed887c3666a94d7ba), spec_fingerprint eb64221a9e3748108a92e2ceccb63e7a11a14e83082401ebbc8c2bfdd7094217. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: eb64221a9e3748108a92e2ceccb63e7a11a14e83082401ebbc8c2bfdd7094217; artifact_sha256: 10530256f9684574b7033781fb7f1af9e7ef5ea65245638ed887c3666a94d7ba; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-040/homo_sapiens_lateral_profile.jpg=55fd8d5270d136ed..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-040/scout_manifest.json=07db0e494d12305a..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-040/thompson1917_leaf759_p740_fig364_durer_profiles.jpg=9e583cdcbd5c7ced...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-28-t1917-040-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
